I'll support you

00:22:57.290 --> 00:22:58.250
I'm on your side

00:22:58.250 --> 00:22:59.510
Jump, jump, pushing the limits is my life story

00:22:59.510 --> 00:23:01.300
Jump, jump, pushing the limits is my life story

