My drive ain't no work of fiction

00:23:05.760 --> 00:23:06.970
I want to see you

00:23:06.970 --> 00:23:08.010
Today, if I can

00:23:08.010 --> 00:23:09.770
After all, my fingers just won't stop

00:23:09.770 --> 00:23:11.140
After all, my fingers just won't stop

